WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Facilitator>This is a short follow-up on providers and authorizations from the data workshop.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:32.000
<v Policy Analyst>Authorized hours can be half-hours, so 12.5 hours a week is valid. A whole number won't be enough.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:45.000
<v State Program Manager>The state has decided co-payment is calculated per authorization, not per case. Each authorization carries its own co-payment amount.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:58.000
<v County Lead>Policy now allows only one active provider per child at a time. A child can change providers, but not have two at once.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:05:02.000
<v Policy Analyst>Every authorization still has a start date and an end date, and we keep every prior version for the auditors.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:44.000
<v Facilitator>Thanks everyone. We will confirm the provider rule in writing.
